      "description": "Not only are we delighted to be partaking in the Affordale Art Fair Battersea for a 3rd year running we are also beyond thrilled to announce that Jayson Lilley will be showcasing a large interactive work in the foyer ‘ I’d Be Lost Without You’. You won’t want to miss this! The fair will run from Wednesday 14th October – Sunday 18th October in Battersea Park and you can find us on S t and C7 where we will be exhibiting 8 incredibly talented artists: A A Watson, Abotz, Ayesha Pearce, Ben Farleigh, Dominic Denis, Graham Gosling, James Talon & of course Jayson Lilley ! Wednesday 14 October Private View 5 – 9pm Thursday 15 October General Admission 11am – 5pm Art After Dark Late* 5 – 9pm Friday 16 October General Admission 11am – 5pm Art After Dark Late* 5 – 9pm Saturday 17 October General Admission 10am – 6pm Family Morning 10am – 12pm Sunday 18 October General Admission 10am – 6pm Family Morning 10am – 12pm *Late events are 18+ only For C omplimentary Tickets please RSVP here We simply can’t wait to see you there! Anna, Charlie & Molly",
